{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cUbDv7WlWl1792990574.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產奧運站奧海城分行首席分區營業經理黃家全表示，中原最新促成一宗利奧坊．壹隅租賃成交，單位為1座中層F室，實用面積265平方呎，屬一房一廁間隔，單位座向西方，外望開揚市景及海景，最新以19000元租出，折合實用呎租72元。<br/>中原地產黃家全指，上址業主於2022年5月以676萬元購入單位，持貨4年，是次租出單位可享3.4厘租金回報，回報理想。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.360130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.024879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:26.792551+00:00","content_hash":"e58a14ac1be2919db8b86654e075e24f4c0a5c2b447b2723f0f61bf8d46415a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.360130+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}